ear-end takes it; if nobody gets there by year twenty, the Chair decides on points. Rivals that fall behind go bankrupt, and the Galaxy News Network is there for every rise and every fall.", "summary": "Starcorp Tycoon is a single and multi-player business tycoon set in the year 2246. You run StarCorp, maker of the drink Gulst, in a sector of 26 star systems and compete with up to seven AI corporations for the market. Chart new systems, found stations, mine steel and ice, research a better product, run marketing campaigns, sign sponsors and grow across the sector, then hold the market at a year-end to win. Pick one of 26 CEOs, each with a case file, play in real time with pause and five speeds, and watch the Galaxy News Network report on everything you do. Free demo for Windows and Mac; playable in 13 languages.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 28, "name": "Business"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/starcorp-tycoon", "videos": [{"id": 201235, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "yMC_19vX7Ng", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yMC_19vX7Ng", "title": "Starcorp Tycoon \u2013 Singleplayer Gameplay Trailer | Early Access", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yMC_19vX7Ng/qhddefault.jpg"}]}